WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
One short question. One response over DNS.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
Write a short question. [Typing and click sounds]

00:08.000 --> 00:13.000
The message travels through an observable DNS route.

00:13.000 --> 00:18.000
The response arrives in TXT records. [Confirmation tone]

00:18.000 --> 00:23.000
No account, API key, or tracking; encrypted local history.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
DNS is not private. Never send secrets or personal data.

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
DNSChat, open source. [Confirmation tone]
